{"channelId":"UCmCE7G76NF7stJIw3aLmLYg","row":["Bodyology Massage Courses",118000,"Bodyology Massage School offers two different services: \nWe are a world-class massage school located in London, United Kingdom. We offer in-person, all-level massage courses and training that are based on solid accreditation, individual support, interactive & fun learning methods. You will get all you need to become a great massage therapist. \nBodyology also offers great all-levels online massage courses, events and educational tips. \nWe are experts in teaching massage techniques, anatomy, physiology, and pathology, ‘tailoring’ massage treatments, building a rapport & safe space with clients, marketing for therapists, risk assessment & more. \nWe love sharing our massage knowledge with the world on YouTube. It’s a way to give back to the world and help people in those rural, distant locations. \nWe produce one new video every week. Subscribe to our channel to receive a notification for every new video. Also, it promotes our videos to be shown to more people on YouTube. \nBodyology team","info@bodyology.org.uk","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmCE7G76NF7stJIw3aLmLYg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmCE7G76NF7stJIw3aLmLYg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:19.197Z","channelId":"UCmCE7G76NF7stJIw3aLmLYg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"5015910ddd1c1a2a670230e030fe760a5391985cb6c9dc11ffd92e93ad717069","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b0429df1ee13a6dfee93011ca7bea6e5a21d261e371db62f6c6245d97edb2145"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmCE7G76NF7stJIw3aLmLYg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:53:22.382Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/bodyologymassageschool","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1554,"raw":"1,554","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/BodyologyMassageSchool/","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:13:4